From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: crypto: sig - Let users ask for an implementation that can sign

ecdsa-generic verifies only.  A driver that can also sign ranks below it
when its verify is slower, so crypto_alloc_sig("ecdsa-nist-p256") never
returns it and a caller with a private key gets -ENOSYS.

Set CRYPTO_SIG_ALG_CAN_SIGN on algorithms with sign and set_priv_key.  A
caller that needs to sign passes it in type and mask.  Add
sig_check_attr_type() so sig templates take that request; rsassa-pkcs1
uses it and always signs.  x962 and p1363 pass the request on and sign
only when the implementation below them signs.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 crypto/ecdsa-p1363.c          | 11 +++++++----
 crypto/ecdsa-x962.c           | 11 +++++++----
 crypto/rsassa-pkcs1.c         |  2 +-
 crypto/sig.c                  | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 include/crypto/internal/sig.h |  2 ++
 include/crypto/sig.h          |  6 ++++++
 6 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crypto/ecdsa-p1363.c b/crypto/ecdsa-p1363.c
index 4f66d67..ce50ff7 100644
--- a/crypto/ecdsa-p1363.c
+++ b/crypto/ecdsa-p1363.c
@@ -132,10 +132,11 @@ static int ecdsa_p1363_create(struct crypto_template *tmpl, struct rtattr **tb)
 	struct crypto_sig_spawn *spawn;
 	struct sig_instance *inst;
 	struct sig_alg *ecdsa_alg;
-	u32 mask;
+	u32 mask, type;
+	bool sign;
 	int err;
 
-	err = crypto_check_attr_type(tb, CRYPTO_ALG_TYPE_SIG, &mask);
+	err = sig_check_attr_type(tb, &mask, &sign);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
@@ -145,8 +146,9 @@ static int ecdsa_p1363_create(struct crypto_template *tmpl, struct rtattr **tb)
 
 	spawn = sig_instance_ctx(inst);
 
+	type = sign ? CRYPTO_SIG_ALG_CAN_SIGN : 0;
 	err = crypto_grab_sig(spawn, sig_crypto_instance(inst),
-			      crypto_attr_alg_name(tb[1]), 0, mask);
+			      crypto_attr_alg_name(tb[1]), type, mask | type);
 	if (err)
 		goto err_free_inst;
 
@@ -167,7 +169,8 @@ static int ecdsa_p1363_create(struct crypto_template *tmpl, struct rtattr **tb)
 	inst->alg.init = ecdsa_p1363_init_tfm;
 	inst->alg.exit = ecdsa_p1363_exit_tfm;
 
-	inst->alg.sign = ecdsa_p1363_sign;
+	if (ecdsa_alg->base.cra_flags & CRYPTO_SIG_ALG_CAN_SIGN)
+		inst->alg.sign = ecdsa_p1363_sign;
 	inst->alg.verify = ecdsa_p1363_verify;
 	inst->alg.key_size = ecdsa_p1363_key_size;
 	inst->alg.max_size = ecdsa_p1363_max_size;
diff --git a/crypto/ecdsa-x962.c b/crypto/ecdsa-x962.c
index c1ff7ca..6bde8f1 100644
--- a/crypto/ecdsa-x962.c
+++ b/crypto/ecdsa-x962.c
@@ -237,10 +237,11 @@ static int ecdsa_x962_create(struct crypto_template *tmpl, struct rtattr **tb)
 	struct crypto_sig_spawn *spawn;
